WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.410
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and welcome to
part 2 of my Walking Dead Season 4 countdown.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:15.059
We’re just celebrating the return with a
short video series just to get pumped up again.

00:00:15.059 --> 00:00:18.440
This time I thought it would be fun to talk
about our biggest questions before episode

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:19.440
9.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.820
There are a few clues that tie in with episode
titles including the finale.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:27.400
I’ll also talk about some things AMC is
super worried about after the list.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.570
Careful for potential spoilers if you don’t
want to know anything.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:35.970
I’ll be doing weekly episode videos starting
sunday along with Q&amp;As and giveaway videos

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:36.970
mondays.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:37.970
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:39.960
I’ll explain the giveaway again before it
starts.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:44.470
So biggest walking dead questions number 10:
Who killed that rabbit in episode 8?

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:48.460
My best guess based on her character arc in
the first half of the season is lizzie.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:52.030
She started of as this really pure little
girl and Carol started to shout the tears

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:53.030
out of her.

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:59.150
Worst IRL parent ever but BEST walking dead
parent ever.

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:03.600
She was even able to shoot someone without
freaking out in episode 8.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:07.390
Number 9: Where did that giant herd of walkers
go from episode 3.

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:11.460
There had to have been at least 5 to 10 thousand
walkers stretched as far as the eye could

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.460
see.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.119
They didn’t just disappear.

00:01:14.119 --> 00:01:17.930
Walkers will generally seek out nearby food,
but in order to travel in a large group like

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:21.619
that over a long distance, someone had to
be influencing them.

00:01:21.619 --> 00:01:25.890
The quick guess is that it’s related to
the villain of the second half of the season.

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:28.860
The governor is gone, so a new big bad will
fill that vaccum of evil soon.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:33.180
Number 8: Who was the voice on the other end
of Daryl’s radio.

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:38.200
The best theories I’ve seen are that it’s
sanctuary.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.179
There’s no guarantee that they’ll find
it this season, but now that they’re looking

00:01:41.179 --> 00:01:42.179
for new shelter.

00:01:42.179 --> 00:01:44.909
Darryl’s group will probably start tracking
down the signal.

00:01:44.909 --> 00:01:47.979
Number 7: Who was on the bus and who ran into
the woods.

00:01:47.979 --> 00:01:51.799
Glenn and Maggie were on the bus, but then
Maggie got stuck with Bob Stokey and Sasha

00:01:51.799 --> 00:01:53.119
trying to find Beth.

00:01:53.119 --> 00:02:01.930
So I think we can call the bus group Glenn’s
Group.

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:04.150
Number 6: Who was feeding the rats?

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:06.520
Short answer, probably lizzie.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.970
But since she kind of checked out mentally
over the course of the season she might not

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:16.210
have been hardcore enough during episode 1,
I also think Carol or a new person could have

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:17.760
done it.

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:23.600
But Right now, based on the Dead Rabbit evidence,
I think that Lizzie is the best guess.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:25.569
Number 5: What happened to lilly?

00:02:25.569 --> 00:02:29.080
The last time we saw her she was still alive
and hadn’t been bitten.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:33.470
She had just killed her better half but I
think she made it into one of the groups fleeing

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:35.110
into the woods on foot.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:38.019
That means Tyreese’s group or maggie’s
group.

00:02:38.019 --> 00:02:41.420
I think rick and carl will be on their own.

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:43.620
Number 4: Is baby Judith Dead?

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:46.849
Beth got off the bus to go get her, and the
car seat was unbuckled.

00:02:46.849 --> 00:02:51.819
So it’s possible that she or someone else
who was injured grabbed her and ran.

00:02:51.819 --> 00:02:54.769
My earlier theory was that it was Tyreese
who looked like he was carrying something

00:02:54.769 --> 00:02:56.939
while running away.

00:02:56.939 --> 00:03:01.970
Episode 9 will probably reveal what happened
so we won’t have to wait long for an answer.

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.439
Number 3: Who is the new villain?

00:03:04.439 --> 00:03:07.510
Episode 9 will be all about the aftermath
of the governor’s attack, so we won’t

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:09.410
meet the new villain for a few episodes.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:14.459
The best theory is that it will be an amalgam
of a couple characters from the comic book.

00:03:14.459 --> 00:03:19.730
I’ll post a link at the end of the video
for details on that.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:22.129
Number 2: Will they reach sanctuary.

00:03:22.129 --> 00:03:24.940
In the comic books this is the next place
they travel to.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:28.610
And based on the timeline at least some of
the prison group will make it there.

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:32.049
I’m betting daryl’s group will make it
first, just because he was the one to hear

00:03:32.049 --> 00:03:34.099
the garbled transmission.

00:03:34.099 --> 00:03:36.190
The voice said sanctuary.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.269
So i think that’s a dead giveaway.

00:03:38.269 --> 00:03:41.090
Number 1: Will they reach the alexandria safe
zone.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:45.329
This is one of the bigger questions and the
season finale is called “A”.

00:03:45.329 --> 00:03:49.650
It’s also possible that the show will mash
both the sanctuary and the safe zone into

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:50.969
one location.

00:03:50.969 --> 00:03:54.180
So let me know what your biggest question
is for the second half of the season.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:58.110
I’ll be doing weekly q&amp;a’s for all the
episodes, so my next one will just be next

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.750
week after episode 9.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:07.549
Now let’s talk about some of the things
AMC the network is really worried about.

00:04:07.549 --> 00:04:13.660
Scott Gimple said recently that the show is
going to get waay darker in the second half.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:18.270
Like a major character death and perpetrating
some horrors as yet unseen in the past 3 seasons.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:30.300
So he said AMC is freaking just a little because
they don’t want to lose their audience.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.630
Personally I think most people watch Walking
Dead understanding that it’s supposed to

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:34.760
make you feel a little sick.

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:36.940
I think that’s just the test of being a
human being.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:40.270
But here’s a big question.

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:45.120
Is there anything Walking Dead could do to
any of the characters that would make you

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.120
stop watching.

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.120
Bad or Good.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.120
It doesn’t just have to be someone dying.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.120
Now for giveaway details again.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:50.120
I think I’m going to change the rules just
to make it easier.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.560
Originally it was going to be guessing the
deaths in each episode.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:58.940
But I think I’ll just pick a random subscriber
from the comments and just give the $20 giftcard

00:04:58.940 --> 00:04:59.940
away.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:06.430
I’ll still be doing a q&amp;a video every monday
after I post review videos.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.770
And I’ll still do a third bonus video.

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:10.480
I think it will just be a top 5 deaths video.

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:20.640
Sometimes the walker kills get pretty epic
so that should be fun.

